        "rationale": "The visible trace shows iot.sensor_stats and iot.stream_extent for Transformer 1 at MAIN, and the reported min/max/mean for oti, oti_a, oti_t, il1, il2, il3 and inut exactly match the tool output; the window (2024-01-15 to 2024-01-19, 5 daily records) is confirmed and the per-phase imbalance percentages (+0.8%, +7.0%, -7.4%) are arithmetically correct with no phase exceeding 10%. The timestamp-level claims (peak oti 87 \u00b0C on 2024-01-16, total current 301 A on 2024-01-16 and 2024-01-18) require a",
